WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.200
Every job you capture, scored against your résumé

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.200
Salary, location and requirements — pulled out automatically

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:14.800
Per requirement: what you have, what you don't, and the evidence

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.400
Disagree? Correct it right where you see it

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.600
The gap moves to met — instantly, with no AI call

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.500
Reopen the job: 84 becomes 94

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:38.200
One correction applies to every job, not just this one

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.800
Runs on your Mac, with the model you choose

